# Created by Russ and Randy on 12-May-11 in and effort to copy
# we assumed a steel saturation of 2.59
# our radius is 90.5cm
# our volume of shim is 195x26x1 in mm's
# M = ( 50.7e-07 x 2.59 ) / ( 4 x PI x e-07 )
#
#
# HDw shims assuming XRMB style trays.
# FILE assume steal saturate at 2.06T.  Volume of steel = 0.85e-07m^3/2
